  "<div class=\"compare-placeholder\"><strong>选好两张表后点击“生成差异计划”</strong><p>· 两侧必须是同一引擎（MySQL→MySQL、PostgreSQL→PostgreSQL、SQLite→SQLite），并且都定义了主键。<br>· 按主键逐行比对：源有目标无 → 新增；主键相同但列值不同 → 只更新变化的列；目标多出的行 → 删除，默认不勾选。<br>· 比对只读取行数据；执行才写入，并需要一个可停止的操作编号与 30 分钟内有效的计划。</p></div>": "<div class=\"compare-placeholder\"><strong>Select both tables, then click \"Generate Diff Plan\"</strong><p>· Both sides must use the same engine (MySQL→MySQL, PostgreSQL→PostgreSQL, SQLite→SQLite) and both tables must define a primary key.<br>· Rows are compared by primary key: present in source but not target → insert; same key but different column values → update only the changed columns; extra target rows → delete, unchecked by default.<br>· Comparing only reads row data; only execution writes, and it requires a stoppable operation ID and a plan valid for 30 minutes.</p></div>",
  "<div class=\"view-heading\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">ROW SYNC</div><h2>数据同步</h2><p>按主键逐行追平两张同引擎的表。</p></div></div>": "<div class=\"view-heading\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">ROW SYNC</div><h2>Data Sync</h2><p>Sync two tables on the same engine row by row, by primary key.</p></div></div>",
