  "<div class=\"view-heading\">\n        <div><div class=\"eyebrow\">ROW SYNC</div><h2>数据同步</h2><p>差异驱动：按主键逐行比对，只把有差异的行写入目标，不改表结构、不整表搬运。要把整张表搬过去请用<b>数据传输</b>，要改结构请用<b>结构比较</b>。</p></div>\n      </div>": "<div class=\"view-heading\">\n        <div><div class=\"eyebrow\">ROW SYNC</div><h2>Data Sync</h2><p>Diff-driven: compares rows by primary key and writes only the rows that differ to the target — no structure changes, no whole-table copies. To move whole tables, use <b>Data Transfer</b>; to change structure, use <b>Structure Compare</b>.</p></div>\n      </div>",
