  "<div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><span>角色生命周期</span><span>立即生效 · 二次确认</span></div>\n        <div class=\"form-grid\">\n          <label>角色名<input id=\"identity-pg-role\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"report_reader\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"full\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:7px\"><input id=\"identity-pg-login\" type=\"checkbox\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px\" />允许登录（创建时设置密码）</label>\n          <label>新密码<input id=\"identity-new-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"至少 8 个字符\" /></label>\n          <label>确认密码<input id=\"identity-confirm-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" /></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-note\"><svg><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg>密码仅用于本次 DDL，执行确认框和只追加审计中都会隐藏。</div>\n        <div class=\"modal-footer\"><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"identity-create\">创建角色</button><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"identity-reset-password\">轮换密码</button><button class=\"danger-button\" data-action=\"identity-drop\">删除角色</button></div>": "<div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><span>Role Lifecycle</span><span>Takes effect immediately · second confirmation</span></div>\n        <div class=\"form-grid\">\n          <label>Role Name<input id=\"identity-pg-role\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"report_reader\" /></label>\n          <label class=\"full\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;align-items:center;gap:7px\"><input id=\"identity-pg-login\" type=\"checkbox\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px\" />Allow login (set a password at creation)</label>\n          <label>New Password<input id=\"identity-new-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\" /></label>\n          <label>Confirm Password<input id=\"identity-confirm-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" /></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-note\"><svg><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg>The password is used only for this DDL and is hidden in the execution confirmation and the append-only audit.</div>\n        <div class=\"modal-footer\"><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"identity-create\">Create Role</button><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"identity-reset-password\">Rotate Password</button><button class=\"danger-button\" data-action=\"identity-drop\">Delete Role</button></div>",
  "<div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><span>Redis ACL 用户</span><span>ACL SETUSER / DELUSER</span></div>\n        <div class=\"form-grid\">\n          <label>ACL 用户名<input id=\"identity-acl-user\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"report_reader\" /></label>\n          <label>权限模板<select id=\"identity-acl-preset\"><option value=\"read\">只读（+@read）</option><option value=\"write\">写入（+@write）</option><option value=\"full\">全部命令（+@all）</option></select></label>\n          <label>新密码<input id=\"identity-acl-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"至少 8 个字符\" /></label>\n          <label>确认密码<input id=\"identity-acl-confirm\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" /></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-note\"><svg><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg>默认 key 模式为 ~*；ACL 密码在确认框和审计摘要中隐藏。</div>\n        <div class=\"modal-footer\"><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"acl-apply\">应用用户与权限</button><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"acl-reset-password\">轮换密码</button><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"acl-enable\">启用</button><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"acl-disable\">禁用</button><button class=\"danger-button\" data-action=\"acl-delete\">删除用户</button></div>": "<div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><span>Redis ACL Users</span><span>ACL SETUSER / DELUSER</span></div>\n        <div class=\"form-grid\">\n          <label>ACL User Name<input id=\"identity-acl-user\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"report_reader\" /></label>\n          <label>Permission Template<select id=\"identity-acl-preset\"><option value=\"read\">Read-only (+@read)</option><option value=\"write\">Write (+@write)</option><option value=\"full\">All commands (+@all)</option></select></label>\n          <label>New Password<input id=\"identity-acl-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\" /></label>\n          <label>Confirm Password<input id=\"identity-acl-confirm\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" /></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-note\"><svg><use href=\"#i-shield\"/></svg>The default key pattern is ~*; ACL passwords are hidden in the confirmation dialog and audit summary.</div>\n        <div class=\"modal-footer\"><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"acl-apply\">Apply User & Privileges</button><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"acl-reset-password\">Rotate Password</button><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"acl-enable\">Enable</button><button class=\"secondary-button\" data-action=\"acl-disable\">Disable</button><button class=\"danger-button\" data-action=\"acl-delete\">Delete User</button></div>",
